es, and morally questionable choices \u2013 created by Squanch Games! \n-Control Trover's movements, but not his mouth. He\u2019s got a lot to say about what\u2019s going on in the game. \n-Travel the cosmos to experience a variety of weird alien planets and characters with big personalities. \n-Upgrade Trover AND YOURSELF with new abilities while evading awkward situations. \n-Immerse yourself in weirdness.", "short_description": "Your pups are missing. The cosmos is at stake. Only you and Trover can save everything in this bizarre comedy adventure!"}]}, "developer_name": "Squanch Games, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squanchgames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Squanch Games, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://squanchgames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "it", "de", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8331953986862755"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974502_883033738774059_912251272713732096_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KuYSxrQRklQQ7kNvwGR2g6v&_nc_oc=AdreyMgpIe5Qdm891i9tl4wS0kjBAo9O5qCVdlH_9wZoTECeGL1vi54YMSUKSClTw_Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLxBckOmh5aECgw-wogsPH_9l60ysne9aHS